# Keep the build context small: the repo root carries gigabytes of build
# state, virtualenvs and diaries the image never needs.
#
# NOTE: `/src` is deliberately NOT here. The image compiles `mooshik` from
# this checkout so the MCP serve child is the same code the library is — see
# ingester/Dockerfile. Excluding it fails the build at `COPY src`.
#
# `*.md` is root-level only (Docker's `*` does not cross `/`), so the
# markdown corpus under ingest-fixtures/ is untouched by it.
/target
/.git
/dev-diary
/docs
/ingester/.venv
/ingester/tests
/measurement
/mcp-servers
*.md
!ingester/README.md
.env
